  POST /pre-consultation/session/complete/
  
  Step 12 — marks session completed. Requires current_layer = patient_health_map (after goals PUT advances layer).
  Sets customer profile is_onboarding_complete = true.
  Reference: docs/pre_consultation/api-pre-consultation.md
